@startuml
title US-003 - Activate member account - SSD level 1
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 75
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF2F8
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FEF9E7
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
autonumber

actor "Invited Person" as Person
participant "Nexo" as System

note over System
  Email/password scenario; provider interaction is not detailed here.
end note
Person -> System: Activate account (email, name, password)
activate System
alt Request accepted
    System --> Person: Existing account activated; signed in
else Invalid required details
    System --> Person: Validation errors; account unchanged
else No pending account for email
    System --> Person: Eligibility or conflict error; account unchanged
end
deactivate System
@enduml
